{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a puzzle-platformer based on real physics. Players must cleverly adjust platform angles to guide a gravity-affected ball through rolling and jumping until it safely reaches the bottom platform. Simple yet challenging!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze time while the ball is mid-air to carefully adjust platforms below</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear levels to unlock 10 unique balls for collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ball types include common sports balls: basketball, soccer, bowling, tennis, golf...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ball has unique bounce, dynamic/static friction, weight and size, creating completely different strategic experiences!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744310?t=1748600200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744310?t=1748600200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744310/f59d1942072b6566071440cc7d277780a973e45b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748600200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744310/f59d1942072b6566071440cc7d277780a973e45b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748600200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a puzzle-platformer based on real physics. Players must cleverly adjust platform angles to guide a gravity-affected ball through rolling and jumping until it safely reaches the bottom platform. Simple yet challenging!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze time w